<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[勾起格栅铭牌 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "勾起格栅铭牌">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<fisticon>><<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($physique or 10000) gte 11500>><<link "拧开排污阀 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#reg-mom-clockwork-2">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($physique or 10000) gte 11500>>
		你握住副排水槽侧面的黄铜排污阀逆时针旋开，积存的温水打着旋排空，露出槽底的铜铭牌与古铜徽章。<span class="green">你兵不血刃地取出了排水槽底的收存。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_moment_clockwork_2_keepsake")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span><</if>>
	<<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[前往别处 (0:04)|MP Region Clockwork Corridor]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
		排污阀螺杆在潮气里锈得颇沉，你拧动时阀口喷出一股闷热白汽，熏得手腕发烫。<span class="red">你忙缩回手避开热汽，等气压稍降再试。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
