<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[旋紧法兰套环 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "旋紧法兰套环">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "体魄：11500 或 科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mprepairicon>><<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 250>><<link "垫入浸油皮圈 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#reg-mom-clockwork-4">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 250>>
		你剪下一圈浸过钟表油的厚牛皮垫片，严丝合缝地嵌入传声铜管松脱的接口法兰盘内。<span class="green">刺耳的漏气声顿时消失，管壁挂钩上的检修信物铜牌袋也归了你。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_moment_clockwork_4_keepsake")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span><</if>>
	<<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[前往别处 (0:04)|MP Region Clockwork Corridor]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
		铜管接口处的高压气流不断外冲，牛皮垫片刚塞入一半便被吹歪，刮红了你的指腹。<span class="red">你只好先按住垫片退开半步，等风压回落再装。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Clockwork 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
