:: MP Region Moment Abbey 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "abbey">><<mpalertinit "abbey">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
静默石阶第二十级踏板下有一道空心回音槽，踩上去时石板微沉，里面似乎卡着一只铜香球。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Sunken Abbey]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br><br>
