<<mpherbicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($physique or 10000) gte 11400>><<link "撬出石边香球 (0:06)">><<mpalert 8>><<pass 6>><<replace "#reg-mom-abbey-1">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($physique or 10000) gte 11400>>
	镂空铜香球里不仅有干枯没药，还藏着两枚古修道院银币。<span class="green">你从石阶暗槽取出了镂空铜香球。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_moment_abbey_1")>><<money 280>><</if>>
	<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[前往别处 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Abbey 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	沉重青石板滑落砸在你的鞋尖上，疼得你倒吸冷气。<span class="red">石板回落磕痛了你的脚趾。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Abbey 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回静默石阶 (0:03)|MP Region Sunken Abbey]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<mpalertgain "锁簧与石面的回声">><<else>><<link [[撬出石边香球 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "撬出石边香球">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 体魄：11400">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<tendingicon>><<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($tending or 0) gte 250>><<link "推出孔内香球 (0:06)">><<mpalert 8>><<pass 6>><<replace "#reg-mom-abbey-1">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($tending or 0) gte 250>>
		你折下一根坚韧的古柏细枝探入石阶侧面的排水孔，顺着空心回音槽将那只镂空铜香球稳稳推了出来。<span class="green">铜香球完好滚入掌心，里面藏着两枚古修道院古铜徽章。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_moment_abbey_1_keepsake")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span><</if>>
	<<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[前往别处 (0:04)|MP Region Abbey Steps]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
