<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[疏通石角松塔 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "疏通石角松塔">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 家政等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mpsewicon>><<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>><<link "封补石槽漏缝 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#reg-mom-druid-2">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>>
		你挖来一捧混着细韧青苔的湿粘土，顺着月泉石槽外侧的裂隙严丝合缝地抹平封实。<span class="green">外溢的泉水重回池心，水底浮起了一枚温润玉珠与古币。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_moment_druid_2_keepsake")>><<set $mpHerbsCollected to ($mpHerbsCollected or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得草药 ×1</span><</if>>
	<<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[前往别处 (0:04)|MP Region Druid Pillars]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
		山泉水不断从石缝里往外渗流，刚抹上的青苔泥被冲散了一角，没能立刻封住。<span class="red">你记下漏缝最宽的位置，准备先垫入两片碎石再封。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Druid 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回深林石环 (0:03)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[封补石槽漏缝 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "封补石槽漏缝">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 意志等级：<span class='blue'>C</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
</div>


:: MP Region Moment Druid 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
古根地穴内侧的石龛里摆着一只泥封的陶土小罐，罐口系着一根编有白狼毛的皮绳。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br><br>
