<<investigateicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($history or 0) gte 260>><<link "解皮绳旋开泥封 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#reg-mom-druid-3">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($history or 0) gte 260>>
	陶罐里装着风干的极品安神香草与几枚奉纳银币。<span class="green">你无损开启了古根地穴的奉纳陶罐。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_moment_druid_3")>><<money 280>><</if>>
	<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[前往别处 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Druid 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	陶罐泥封碎裂划破了你的指尖。<span class="red">干硬泥封刮伤了你的指腹。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Druid 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回石柱林 (0:03)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[解皮绳旋开泥封 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "解皮绳旋开泥封">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 历史等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mplockpickicon>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 260>><<link "挑开罐口泥封 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#reg-mom-druid-3">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 260>>
		你握住薄刃骨刀贴着陶罐口沿的凹槽缓缓旋切，整块泥封完好剥落而未掉进半粒泥屑。<span class="green">罐内封存的安神香草与奉纳古铜徽章散发着岁月清香。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_moment_druid_3_keepsake")>><<set $mpHerbsCollected to ($mpHerbsCollected or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得草药 ×1</span><</if>>
	<<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[前往别处 (0:04)|MP Region Druid Pillars]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
		古根地穴里阴冷潮湿，泥封受潮后黏韧异常，骨刀切入一半便有些滞涩。<span class="red">手臂举得有些发沉，你只好先收刀歇一口气。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Druid 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回深林石环 (0:03)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[挑开罐口泥封 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "挑开罐口泥封">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
</div>


:: MP Region Moment Druid 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
守林人瞭望台顶层的铜风向标被藤蔓缠住了尾翼，在山风里发出沉闷的吱呀声。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br><br>
<div id="reg-mom-druid-4">
<<investigateicon>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 250 or ($danceskill or 0) gte 250>><<link "割断风标藤蔓 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#reg-mom-druid-4">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 250 or ($danceskill or 0) gte 250>>
	铜风向标重新灵活转向，底座卡槽里掉出一枚银鹰徽记。<span class="green">瞭望台风向标恢复了灵敏转动。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_moment_druid_4")>><<money 280>><</if>>
	<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[前往别处 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Druid 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	高处山风猛烈，吹得你在木栏边晃了一下磕到膝盖。<span class="red">狂风吹晃身形，膝盖磕在木栏上。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Druid 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回石柱林 (0:03)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[割断风标藤蔓 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "割断风标藤蔓">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "运动等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 舞蹈等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mprepairicon>><<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($tending or 0) gte 250>><<link "注油风标转轴 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#reg-mom-druid-4">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($tending or 0) gte 250>>
		你爬上瞭望台木栏，往铜风向标干涩的转轴缝隙里滴入几滴松节油，再轻轻拨转尾翼。<span class="green">风向标顿时灵活旋动，底座卡槽里掉出了一枚银鹰徽记。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_moment_druid_4_keepsake")>><<set $mpHerbsCollected to ($mpHerbsCollected or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得草药 ×1</span><</if>>
	<<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[前往别处 (0:04)|MP Region Druid Pillars]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
		瞭望台高处山风猎猎，松节油刚滴出壶嘴便被吹偏，缠在尾翼上的老藤仍在原处。<span class="red">木栏在风中微微摇晃，你忙扶稳立柱退回台内。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Druid 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回深林石环 (0:03)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[注油风标转轴 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "注油风标转轴">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
</div>


:: MP Region Moment Druid 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
石环外围的兽径旁立着一块半截入土的指路石碑，碑面上的古星辰方位被厚青苔遮住了。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br><br>
<div id="reg-mom-druid-5">
<<mpcleanicon>><<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or ($history or 0) gte 260>><<link "刷净碑面苔藓 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#reg-mom-druid-5">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or ($history or 0) gte 260>>
	古碑方位清晰重现，你在碑座下摸到了巡山人留下的铜币。<span class="green">你清理并拓下了指路古碑的符文。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_moment_druid_5")>><<money 280>><</if>>
	<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[深入 (0:03)|MP Region Moment Druid 6]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	石碑背面的荆棘刺破了你的袖口与手腕。<span class="red">荆棘刺在手腕上留下一道红痕。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Druid 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回通风处 (0:03)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[刷净碑面苔藓 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "刷净碑面苔藓">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "家政等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 历史等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<if ($english or 0) gte 260 or ($science or 0) gte 260>><<link "拓下星辰符文 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#reg-mom-druid-5">>
<<if ($english or 0) gte 260 or ($science or 0) gte 260>>
		你将绵软的宣纸平铺在指路石碑表面，用湿布团轻轻捶拓，星辰方位符文清晰地印在纸上。<span class="green">拓片字口分明，你在碑座下还摸到了巡山人留下的铜币。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_moment_druid_5_keepsake")>><<set $mpHerbsCollected to ($mpHerbsCollected or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得草药 ×1</span><</if>>
	<<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	
<<else>>
		林间忽然掠过一阵鸦鸣与风声，吹得宣纸边角掀起，拓印出的符文重影了一角。<span class="red">你连忙按住纸角收起拓包，准备等风停后再拓。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Druid 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回石柱林 (0:03)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[拓下星辰符文 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "拓下星辰符文">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "英语等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
</div>


:: MP Region Moment Velvet 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "velvet">><<mpalertinit "velvet">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
丝绒假面回廊的第三座壁龛下，一副镶着孔雀羽的银半面具搭扣松脱，挂在丝绸衬垫边缘摇摇欲坠。
