<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>>
	面具稳稳归位，衬垫夹层里露出了一枚不记名银筹码。<span class="green">你修好了壁龛里的孔雀羽银面具。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_moment_velvet_1")>><<money 280>><</if>>
	<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[前往别处 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Velvet 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	面具边缘的金属花丝刮破了你的指尖。<span class="red">金属花丝在指尖划出一道细印。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Velvet 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回通风处 (0:03)|MP Region Velvet Mirage]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[系紧面具搭扣 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "系紧面具搭扣">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "家政等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mprepairicon>><<if ($danceskill or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 250>><<link "调稳羽面具衬垫 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#reg-mom-velvet-1">>
<<if ($danceskill or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 250>>
		你伸指探入壁龛底座，将孔雀羽银面具下方的丝绸衬垫拨正垫高，让暗钩重新咬合稳固。<span class="green">面具端正归位，衬垫夹层里露出了一枚不记名银筹码。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_moment_velvet_1_keepsake")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span><</if>>
	<<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[前往别处 (0:04)|MP Region Velvet Masque]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
		壁龛内光线幽暗，丝绸衬垫下的金属暗钩角度刁钻，你拨动了两次都没能挂上。<span class="red">走廊尽头隐约传来谈笑声，你只好先收回手。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Velvet 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回假面回廊 (0:03)|MP Region Velvet Mirage]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[调稳羽面具衬垫 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "调稳羽面具衬垫">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "舞蹈等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
</div>


:: MP Region Moment Velvet 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "velvet">><<mpalertinit "velvet">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
镜面试衣沙龙的化妆台抽屉卡在了半途，一串碎珍珠卡在木滑轨里，散发出淡淡的白麝香。
