	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_moment_velvet_2_keepsake")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span><</if>>
	<<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[前往别处 (0:04)|MP Region Velvet Masque]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	梳妆台上的香水瓶被震得晃动起来，你连忙腾出手扶住瓶身。<span class="red">为防打翻器物，你只得先把抽屉放回原处。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Velvet 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回天鹅绒厅 (0:03)|MP Region Velvet Mirage]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<mpalertgain "帷幔后的细响">><<else>><<link [[抬起抽屉归位 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "抬起抽屉归位">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "家政等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
</div>


:: MP Region Moment Velvet 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "velvet">><<mpalertinit "velvet">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
露台观海雅座的香槟冰桶底座压着半张被夜露打湿的乐谱，海风吹得纸角猎猎作响。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Velvet Mirage]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br><br>
<div id="reg-mom-velvet-3">
<<mpcarryicon>><<if ($physique or 10000) gte 11400 or ($danceskill or 0) gte 250>><<link "抬起冰桶取乐谱 (0:06)">><<mpalert 8>><<pass 6>><<replace "#reg-mom-velvet-3">>
<<if ($physique or 10000) gte 11400 or ($danceskill or 0) gte 250>>
	乐谱背面显出一串筹码兑付码，你在侍者台兑出了一笔零钱。<span class="green">你烘出了乐谱背面的筹码暗记。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_moment_velvet_3")>><<money 280>><</if>>
	<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[前往别处 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Velvet 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	冰桶冷凝水洒在你的袖口上，冻得手腕一哆嗦。<span class="red">冰水打湿袖口，纸角也撕裂了半寸。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Velvet 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回假面回廊 (0:03)|MP Region Velvet Mirage]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<mpalertgain "帷幔后的细响">><<else>><<link [[抬起冰桶取乐谱 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "抬起冰桶取乐谱">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "体魄：11400 或 舞蹈等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($english or 0) gte 260>><<link "烘干乐谱密纹 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#reg-mom-velvet-3">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($english or 0) gte 260>>
		你将半湿的乐谱凑近观海雅座的银烛台上方，隔着恰当的距离慢慢烘干纸页背面的水汽。<span class="green">受热显影的筹码兑付码浮现出来，你在侍者台兑出了赏钱。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_moment_velvet_3_keepsake")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span><</if>>
	<<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[前往别处 (0:04)|MP Region Velvet Masque]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
		露台海风吹得烛火忽明忽暗，你怕火苗燎黄乐谱纸边，只得频频挪开距离。<span class="red">纸页还没完全烘透，你决定拿回室内壁灯下再烘。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Velvet 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回前厅 (0:03)|MP Region Velvet Mirage]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[烘干乐谱密纹 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "烘干乐谱密纹">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 英语等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
</div>


:: MP Region Moment Velvet 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "velvet">><<mpalertinit "velvet">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
私人拍卖暗厅的环形看台软垫下，一只遗落的象牙小折扇半露在外，扇骨上拴着金丝穗。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Velvet Mirage]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br><br>
<div id="reg-mom-velvet-4">
<<investigateicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($seductionskill or 0) gte 250>><<link "借裙摆收金筹 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#reg-mom-velvet-4">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($seductionskill or 0) gte 250>>
	扇柄暗格里塞着一张小额筹码券，被你顺手收入囊中。<span class="green">你取得了象牙折扇夹层里的筹码券。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_moment_velvet_4")>><<money 280>><</if>>
	<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[前往别处 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Velvet 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	象牙扇骨的弹簧卡扣弹了一下你的虎口。<span class="red">扇骨卡扣夹痛了你的虎口。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Velvet 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回假面回廊 (0:03)|MP Region Velvet Mirage]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[借裙摆收金筹 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "借裙摆收金筹">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 魅力等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<if ($english or 0) gte 260 or ($maths or 0) gte 260>><<link "借折扇抄底价 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#reg-mom-velvet-4">>
<<if ($english or 0) gte 260 or ($maths or 0) gte 260>>
		你展开那柄遗落的象牙折扇挡在半脸前，借着扇面掩护将夹层里的拍品底价与筹码券默记收妥。<span class="green">周围宾客只道你在纳凉，谁也没察觉你已收起筹码券。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_moment_velvet_4_keepsake")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span><</if>>
	<<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[前往别处 (0:04)|MP Region Velvet Masque]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
		折扇扇骨上涂着一层滑腻的香蜡，你单手拨动暗格时指尖打滑，没能一次顶开。<span class="red">手腕略有些酸涩，你合拢折扇假装闭目养神。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Velvet 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回前厅 (0:03)|MP Region Velvet Mirage]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[借折扇抄底价 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "借折扇抄底价">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "英语等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 数学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
</div>


:: MP Region Moment Velvet 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "velvet">><<mpalertinit "velvet">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
天鹅绒门廊尽头的紫水晶壁灯忽明忽暗，灯座下方的调压铜阀积了一层香灰。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Velvet Mirage]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br><br>
<div id="reg-mom-velvet-5">
<<investigateicon>><<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250>><<link "吹净香灰旋铜阀 (0:06)">><<mpalert 8>><<pass 6>><<replace "#reg-mom-velvet-5">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250>>
	壁灯恢复柔和暖紫光芒，灯座凹槽里露出了侍者留下的备用赏钱。<span class="green">紫水晶壁灯恢复了柔和稳定的暖光。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_moment_velvet_5")>><<money 280>><</if>>
	<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[深入 (0:03)|MP Region Moment Velvet 6]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	滚烫的铜灯座烫红了你的指腹。<span class="red">壁灯铜座烫红了你的指尖。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Velvet 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回假面回廊 (0:03)|MP Region Velvet Mirage]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<mpalertgain "帷幔后的细响">><<else>><<link [[吹净香灰旋铜阀 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "吹净香灰旋铜阀">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 家政等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mprepairicon>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>><<link "扶正水晶灯罩 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#reg-mom-velvet-5">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>>
		你踩上脚踏凳双手托住倾斜的紫水晶灯罩，顺着黄铜卡圈将其缓缓扶正并旋紧调光轮。<span class="green">壁灯重新绽放出柔和暖紫光芒，灯座凹槽里露出了备用赏钱。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_moment_velvet_5_keepsake")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span><</if>>
	<<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	
<<else>>
		水晶灯罩切面繁复且带着余温，你托举时灯座下方的调光轮发出一声轻微刮擦。<span class="red">为免惊动门廊侍者，你忙放轻动作退下脚踏凳。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Velvet 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回天鹅绒厅 (0:03)|MP Region Velvet Mirage]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[扶正水晶灯罩 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "扶正水晶灯罩">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 意志等级：<span class='blue'>C</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
</div>


:: MP Region Moment Observatory 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
折光穹顶室的副寻星镜目镜蒙了一层水雾，镜筒下方的微调蜗杆也有些发涩。
