	寻星镜视野重归清澈，镜架托盘下露出了前辈留下的实验补贴。<span class="green">副寻星镜重新对准了北极星轨。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_moment_observatory_1")>><<money 280>><</if>>
	<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
