	<<walkicon>><<link [[前往别处 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Observatory 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	微调蜗杆卡死反弹，磕痛了你的指甲。<span class="red">蜗杆回弹磕痛了你的指尖。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Observatory 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回折光穹顶 (0:03)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[擦净目镜水雾 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "擦净目镜水雾">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "家政等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<if ($maths or 0) gte 260 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>><<if Time.dayState is "night" or Time.dayState is "dusk">><<link "微调蜗杆对星 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#reg-mom-observatory-1">>
<<if ($maths or 0) gte 260 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>>
		你握住副寻星镜侧面的黄铜微调蜗杆，顺着刻度盘一格格缓慢旋动，将十字丝精准对准北极星位。<span class="green">视野重归澄澈清晰，镜架托盘下的实验补贴也归了你。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_moment_observatory_1_keepsake")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span><</if>>
	<<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[前往别处 (0:04)|MP Region Observatory Dome]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
		穹顶天窗灌进的夜风吹得你指尖微凉，旋动微调蜗杆时十字丝偏出了视场半寸。<span class="red">长时间仰头对焦令肩颈微酸，你只得先停手揉了揉脖子。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Observatory 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回天文翼楼 (0:03)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">微调蜗杆对星 (0:06)（仅限夜晚）</span><</if>><<else>><<link [[微调蜗杆对星 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "微调蜗杆对星">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "数学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
</div>


