		你一手稳稳托住铜地球仪南极底座，一手将松脱的赤道环重新卡回二十三度半的倾角刻度槽。<span class="green">地球仪恢复平稳旋转，空心球腹里滑出了一枚古旧银校徽。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_moment_observatory_2_keepsake")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span><</if>>
