<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[校正倾角刻度 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "校正倾角刻度">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "历史等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 数学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
</div>


:: MP Region Moment Observatory 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
标本陈列暗阁的萤石展柜里，一块三棱光学玻璃滑落到了天鹅绒衬布外，挡住了柜门锁舌。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br><br>
<div id="reg-mom-observatory-3">
<<mpeavesdropicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 250>><<link "拨正门缝棱镜 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#reg-mom-observatory-3">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 250>>
	三棱镜折射出绚丽七彩光斑，底座下还压着一枚纪念银币。<span class="green">你将光学三棱镜完好归回展位。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_moment_observatory_3")>><<money 280>><</if>>
	<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[前往别处 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Observatory 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	展柜铜边划破了你的手背皮肤。<span class="red">铜框边缘在手背上划出红印。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Observatory 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回折光穹顶 (0:03)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[拨正门缝棱镜 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "拨正门缝棱镜">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mpreadicon>><<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250>><<link "旋松合页取棱镜 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#reg-mom-observatory-3">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250>>
		你用随身小刀旋松展柜侧面的黄铜合页，让柜门让出半寸空隙取出三棱镜。<span class="green">光学棱镜与柜底纪念币一并收入囊中。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_moment_observatory_3_keepsake")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span><</if>>
	<<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[前往别处 (0:04)|MP Region Observatory Dome]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	合页螺丝锈得颇紧，刀尖打滑在铜框上擦出一声轻响。<span class="red">手腕震得发酸，合页仍未松开。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Observatory 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回天文翼楼 (0:03)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[旋松合页取棱镜 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "旋松合页取棱镜">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 家政等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
</div>


:: MP Region Moment Observatory 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
钟楼连廊的石拱窗下，一只记录夜间风速的纸滚筒气压计墨水干涸，画针在纸面上空刮。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br><br>
<div id="reg-mom-observatory-4">
<<investigateicon>><<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($tending or 0) gte 250>><<link "滴甘油调开蓝墨 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#reg-mom-observatory-4">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($tending or 0) gte 250>>
	画针重新在滚筒上绘出平稳气压线，底盒里放着观测津贴。<span class="green">自记气压计恢复了连续绘线。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_moment_observatory_4")>><<money 280>><</if>>
	<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[前往别处 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Observatory 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	画针尖端扎了一下你的指尖，染上一小点蓝墨。<span class="red">画针刺痛指尖并沾上了蓝墨水。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Observatory 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回折光穹顶 (0:03)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[滴甘油调开蓝墨 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "滴甘油调开蓝墨">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mpclockworkicon>><<if ($maths or 0) gte 260 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250>><<link "上紧气压计发条 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#reg-mom-observatory-4">>
<<if ($maths or 0) gte 260 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250>>
		你取出黄铜钥匙插进自记气压计底座，顺时针匀速上紧发条，带动记录滚筒重新平稳走纸。<span class="green">画针绘出连续清晰的紫墨曲线，底盒里的观测信物铜牌也落入你手。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_moment_observatory_4_keepsake")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span><</if>>
	<<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[前往别处 (0:04)|MP Region Observatory Dome]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
		气压计发条盘到了后半程阻力骤增，钥匙柄在指间滑了一下，没能挂上止逆齿。<span class="red">你记下发条棘轮的圈数，准备换个顺手角度再拧。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Observatory 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回天文翼楼 (0:03)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[上紧气压计发条 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "上紧气压计发条">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "数学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 家政等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
</div>


:: MP Region Moment Observatory 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
天文翼楼连廊角落的樟木伞架底下，卡着一只早年学生天文社遗落的黄铜星盘盒。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br><br>
<div id="reg-mom-observatory-5">
<<investigateicon>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 250 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250>><<link "倾倒黄盘盒 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#reg-mom-observatory-5">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 250 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250>>
	星盘盒里收着一枚完好的黄道刻度盘与社团活动余款。<span class="green">你找到了早年天文社遗落的星盘盒。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_moment_observatory_5")>><<money 280>><</if>>
	<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[深入 (0:03)|MP Region Moment Observatory 6]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	樟木伞架边角磕在你的膝盖上，带来一阵酸痛。<span class="red">伞架木棱磕痛了你的膝盖。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Observatory 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回折光穹顶 (0:03)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[倾倒黄盘盒 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "倾倒黄盘盒">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "运动等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 家政等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 260>><<link "挑开星盒铜扣 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#reg-mom-observatory-5">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 260>>
		你蹲在樟木伞架旁，用随身小刀薄刃贴着星盘木盒的铜搭扣缝隙轻轻一挑，锈死的搭扣应声弹开。<span class="green">盒内的黄道刻度盘与早年社团活动余款完好呈现。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_moment_observatory_5_keepsake")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span><</if>>
	<<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	
<<else>>
		连廊角落光线昏暗，铜搭扣内侧的暗簧卡得很紧，刀尖挑动时擦出一声轻响。<span class="red">眼角有些发涩难辨细处，你决定把木盒挪到窗边光亮处再开。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Observatory 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回天文翼楼 (0:03)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[挑开星盒铜扣 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "挑开星盒铜扣">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

